   feedIndustryDemand2025:{publisher:"Direktorat Pakan, Direktorat Jenderal Peternakan dan Kesehatan Hewan, Kementerian Pertanian",title:"Pemanfaatan Jagung Lokal oleh Industri Pakan Tahun 2024",publicationYear:2025,referenceDataYear:2024,volume:"Vol. 6 Tahun 2025",url:"https://ditjenpkh.pertanian.go.id/storage/master/file/8EG4sdWw_2025_Buku_Jagung_%281%29.pdf",table:"Table 26, Proyeksi Kebutuhan Jagung Industri Pakan Tahun 2025 Antar Wilayah",unit:"tonne/year",value:8844096,qualityStatus:"official_projection",sourceArithmeticAudit:{publishedMonthlyAverageTon:727010,impliedMonthlyAverageTon:737008,monthlyAverageDifferenceTon:-9998,quarterlyTotalsTon:[2295098,2148839,2200079,2200080],quarterlyTotalsSumTon:8844096,annualTotalTon:8844096,status:"source_arithmetic_discrepancy_preserved",note:"Table 26 quarterly totals sum to the published annual total. Annual total / 12 = 737,008 t/month, but prose reports 727.01 thousand t/month; preserve both and flag the 9,998 t/month discrepancy."},seriesDefinition:"SiJagung-reported 2025 need projection by feed industry, tabulated by region and quarter",note:"Table 26 totals the quarterly SiJagung-reported industry need projection. It is distinct from the ~8.25 Mt factory purchase/absorption series in Kementan Pusdatin Figure 5.4. Both concern 2025 but are not interchangeable. The prose monthly average 727.01 thousand t is also inconsistent with 8,844,096/12 = 737,008 t/month; preserve the 9,998 t/month discrepancy."}
